    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i just got told i have hyperthyroidism like my thyroid is working too hard lol. but i also take adderall for my adhd and i've been feeling way more jittery and like my heart is racing lately. is it okay to keep taking my normal dose or should i be worried about combining them?",
