    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should talk to my doctor but i cant get an appointment for like two weeks and the jitters are making it hard to focus on work. i feel like the adderall is what's causing the heart racing more than the thyroid stuff. if i just take a half dose for a few days until my appointment, would that be safer or is that also a bad idea?",
